  "description": "Find the length of the longest substring that contains at most two distinct characters.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "1. map = {}, left = 0, maxLen = 0\n2. for right = 0 to n-1:\n3.   map[s[right]] = (map[s[right]] || 0) + 1\n4.   while map.size > 2:\n5.     map[s[left]]--\n6.     if map[s[left]] == 0: delete map[s[left]]\n7.     left++\n8.   maxLen = max(maxLen, right - left + 1)",
